# DISCOVERY — the swipe stack and votes for {{familyMemberId}}.
# Set @recipeId before voting. See README.md for environments and labels.

@recipeId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### READ ONLY — Current voting session
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/discovery/session
Accept: application/json
X-Hearth-Secret: {{hearthSecret}}

### READ ONLY — Categories with recipes left to vote on
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/discovery/categories
Accept: application/json
X-Hearth-Secret: {{hearthSecret}}
X-Family-Member-Id: {{familyMemberId}}

### READ ONLY — Recipes not voted on yet (optional ?category= or ?cuisine=)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/discovery
Accept: application/json
X-Hearth-Secret: {{hearthSecret}}
X-Family-Member-Id: {{familyMemberId}}

### CHANGES DATA — Vote Like (1)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/discovery/{{recipeId}}/vote
Content-Type: application/json
X-Hearth-Secret: {{hearthSecret}}
X-Family-Member-Id: {{familyMemberId}}

{
  "vote": 1
}

### CHANGES DATA — Vote Dislike (2)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/discovery/{{recipeId}}/vote
Content-Type: application/json
X-Hearth-Secret: {{hearthSecret}}
X-Family-Member-Id: {{familyMemberId}}

{
  "vote": 2
}
